        <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>The HiPerGuard MV UPS is the ideal solution for data centers that need power protection in the multi-MV range.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content-block" style="margin-top: 30px;">
            <p>On request, the HiPerGuard MV UPS will step in to supply power to the site in the event of a grid failure, or to drain the on grid, allowing it to recover. If the grid is restored, the UPS will seamlessly transfer the load to the grid, supplying the full load and inject just enough reactive power to the grid – i.e., the maximum available power to be injected into the grid is determined by the HiPerGuard MV UPS system rating minus the required load power.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="two-column" style="margin-top: 50px;">
            <div class="column">
                <div class="section-title">The HiPerGuard's modular approach allows un-paralleled serviceability and redundancy while maximizing uptime. The large data center MV UPS is the ideal solution for large data centers that need power protection in the multi-MV range and the UPS covers every aspect the data center needs from power protection to grid support, minimizing maintenance and maximizing efficiency, leading to an optimal total cost of ownership.</div>
            </div>
